st famous role, in which she has played Gloria Delgado-Pritchett in ABC's Modern Family since 2009, she was nominated for four Golden Globe Awards, four Primetime Emmy Awards, and eleven Screen Actors Guild Awards.\\n\\nMoving to the United States in 1998, Vergara soon ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.rubicon.com/blog/celebrating-hispanic-american-entrepreneurs/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d193\"},\"ref\":\"d193\",\"snippet\":\" ... the Pritchetts, the Delgados and the Dunphys. These three families with very different profiles are evolving in front of the camera for documentary purposes. In turns, all the characters step in front of the audience. Overall, the show has about ten main characters that we follow during 11 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.tvfestival.com/en/news/6-tv-shows-with-an-ensemble-cast-to-rediscover/352\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d194\"},\"ref\":\"d194\",\"snippet\":\" ... Fey should really give herself more credit as most showrunners could only dream of producing a pilot this hilarious.\\n\\n#2: \\\"Pilot\\\"\\n\\n\\\"Modern Family\\\" (2009-)\\n\\nNow among the most popular and acclaimed comedies on television, everybody knows that the Dunphys, Pritchetts, Delgados, and Tuckers are all one big, happy ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.watchmojo.com/articles/top-10-pilot-episodes-of-tv-sitcoms\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d188\"},\"ref\":\"d188\",\"snippet\":\" ... Over the course of eleven seasons, it depicts the antics of the chaotic Pritchett-Dunphy-Tucker family, linked by the patriarch Jay Pritchett (portrayed by the incomparable Ed O'Neill). It also features his vivacious second wife Gloria (Sofía Vergara), and her wise-beyond-his-years son Manny ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/the-most-popular-tv-shows-of-the-2000s-according-to-imdb/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d126\"},\"ref\":\"d126\",\"snippet\":\" ... The sitcom became known for its mockumentary style, where the characters often directly address the camera in candid interviews. Modern Family earned recognition for its quirky characters and settings, supported by solid performances by Sofía Vergara as Gloria, Ty Burrell as Phil, Jesse Tyler Ferguson as Mitchell, and ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/longest-running-sitcoms-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d185\"},\"ref\":\"d185\",\"snippet\":\" ... the Dunphys, consisting of Phil and Claire and their kids Haley, Alex, and Luke; Jay Pritchett and his much younger wife Gloria and her son Manny (and later Joe); and Mitchell Pritchett and Cameron Tucker, who adopt their Vietnamese daughter Lily as a baby. The massive blended family ... \",\"title\":\"https://movieweb.com/longest-running-sitcoms-of-all-time/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d210\"},\"ref\":\"d210\",\"snippet\":\" ... List of action films of the 1990s - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2008-10-17\\n---\\nThis is chronological list of action films released in the 1990s. Often there may be considerable overlap particularly between action and other genres (including horror, comedy, and science fiction films); the list should attempt to document ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_action_films_of_the_1990s\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ran