sted\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"7deee65c3eedcc29e4c02ec5e6ead77f8d3e83a6d127c030004f60bc0d8451b7\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Modern Family Gloria husbands Javier Jay children Manny Joe Fulgencio\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d125\"},\"ref\":\"d125\",\"snippet\":\" ... Did you know that Modern Family's Sofia Vergara gave birth to her son, Manolo Gonzalez-Ripoll Vergara, when she was just 19 years old? Jamie-Lynn Spears is such a pro at parenting now that it's easy to forget she was only 16 when she announced ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.sheknows.com/parenting/slideshow/8884/celebs-who-got-pregnant-young/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d149\"},\"ref\":\"d149\",\"snippet\":\" ... 18Sofia Vergara\\n\\nGetty Images Sofia Vergara gave birth to her son, Manolo Gonzalez-Ripoll Vergara, when she was 19.\\n\\nAdvertisement - Continue Reading Below\\n\\n19Jamie Lynn Spears\\n\\nGetty Images Jamie Lynn Spears was just 16 when she announced she was expecting her daughter, Maddie Briann Aldridge (now 11).\\n\\n20Solange ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.harpersbazaar.com/celebrity/latest/g12458265/celebrities-who-had-kids-by-20/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d150\"},\"ref\":\"d150\",\"snippet\":\" ... 20 Times Katie Holmes Shined as a Single Mom\\n\\nSofia Vergara\\n\\nWhen Sofia Vergara married Joe Manganiello in 2015, people immediately began asking the Modern Family star whether the couple planned to have a child together. But at the time, Sofia said \\\"it's not a priority\\\" and ... \",\"title\":\"https://mom.com/entertainment/celebrity-parents-one-and-done-only-child\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d152\"},\"ref\":\"d152\",\"snippet\":\" ... But I knew what being broke felt like, and I never wanted to have that feeling again.\\\"\\n\\n-\\n\\nSofia Vergara\\n\\nSofia Vergara had her son, Manolo Gonzalez-Ripoll Vergara, when she was 19, and raised him as a single mother. Now, the pair are just as close as ever ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.sheknows.com/parenting/slideshow/2215729/celeb-moms-with-one-child/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d151\"},\"ref\":\"d151\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sofía Vergara\\n\\nVergara gave birth to her son Manolo Gonzalez-Ripoll Vergara in 1992 when she was just 19-years-old. She had married her high-school sweetheart, Joe Gonzalez at 18. The two divorced a year after their son was born.\\n\\nSolange Knowles\\n\\nBlue Ivy has an ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.marieclaire.com/celebrity/g19484422/celebrities-with-kids-you-didnt-know-about/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d126\"},\"ref\":\"d126\",\"snippet\":\" ... Modern Family earned recognition for its quirky characters and settings, supported by solid performances by Sofía Vergara as Gloria, Ty Burrell as Phil, Jesse Tyler Ferguson as Mitchell, and Julie Bowen as Claire. — Maddie P\\n\\n- Cast\\n\\n- Ed O'Neill, Sofia Vergara, Julie Bowen, Ty Burrell, Jesse Tyler Ferguson ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/longest-running-sitcoms-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d153\"},\"ref\":\"d153\",\"snippet\":\" ... The actress created the account @GinoTheGerman and captioned this first family photo \\\"I'm here. I'm home\\\".\\n\\nSofia Vergara snaps an adorable photo of hubby Joe Manganiello snuggling their doggy niece Baguette. Baguette the dog belongs to Sofia's son Manolo Gonzalez Vergara, although she looks very ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nydailynews.com/2023/05/03/famous-celebrity-pets/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d127\"},\"ref\":\"d127\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sofia Vergara and Joe Manganiello in July would get messy. But there was one issue over which tears might be shed: Who would get custody of Bubbles?\\n\\nThe 10-year-old dog, a Chihuahua/Pomeranian mix, initially was supposed to be Vergara's pet. The \\\"Modern Family\\\" star ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.mercurynews.com/2023/12/08/celebrity-heartbreak-2023-the-15-most-shocking-messy-splits-of-the-year/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d208\"},\"ref\":\"d208\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Female Brain also starred prominent names in the industry, like Sofía Vergara, Cecily Strong, and James Marsden. The Female Brain was about the examination of differences between the male and female brain.\\n\\n6 Kareem Abdul-Jabbar\\n\\nKareem Abdul-Jabbar had a lengthy basketball and acting career. Abdul ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbr.com/basketball-players-turned-actors/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d207\"},\"ref\":\"d207\",\"snippet\":\" ... While ultimately a feel-good, comeback story, Chef still finds introspective ways of dealing with family and the passionate chase of a dream. The story is authentic at its core and along with a solid cast that includes Sofia Vergara, Scarlett Johansson, and Emjay Anthony, there's definitely ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/actor-directed-2010s-films-that-star-themselves/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"25defe6807f5f3a7624dc080d2d4957bf8c3fb1d9b75c403c77a48980cb74425\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"f3807cdc569c3252ab1c59868b1954862e2bbe6e81b60d0098a570fedc865733\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Sofia Vergara son Manolo Modern Family cameo\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_1b26b510782549788d9ea259"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues. The \"character married 3 times, only one child survives, plays with real-life relative though unrelated in series\" is very specific. This sounds like it could be from a telenovela or a long-running drama. Let me think about shows that started between 2001-2019 with more than 3 seasons. The \"real-life relative playing unrelated character\" is a strong clue. Let me search for specific shows.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Sofia Vergara Wikipedia height\", \"Gloria Delgado-Pritchett Wikipedia character\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_b0843c6111804757b8a5de1a","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Modern Family Gloria husbands Javier Jay children Manny Joe Fulgencio\", \"Sofia Vergara son Manolo Modern Family cameo\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_e61bc25234ce44958341b1e1","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":true,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d124\"},\"ref\":\"d124\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/15-over-50s-celebrity-couples-162732